<title>FRANCE: Dassault says Falcon 50EX gets certificate.</title>
<headline>Dassault says Falcon 50EX gets certificate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Dassault Aviation said in a statement on Wednesday its Falcon 50EX business jet had got certification from the French authorities and that the same process was underway in the United States.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
